rows.skillDesc:
While　Stussy　is　on　the　field,　there　is　a　<color=#d14e0d>{buffodds}%</color>　chance　that　<color=#d14e0d>common　buffs</color>　on　front-row　allies　cannot　be　removed　in　the　first　turn.　When　her　Ultimate　hits,　she　steals　<color=#d14e0d>{buffper3,19241}%</color>　of　the　target's　current　Toughness　ATK　and　<color=#d14e0d>{buffper3,19242}%</color>　of　its　current　Toughness　DEF.　Her　boost　lasts　<color=#d14e0d>3</color>　turns　and　stacks　up　to　<color=#d14e0d>2</color>　times;　each　target　can　be　drained　at　most　<color=#d14e0d>2</color>　times.　The　target　loses　the　corresponding　stats　until　its　Toughness　is　restored　<color=#d14e0d>5</color>　times.
At　battle　start,　if　all　three　CP0　members　are　present,　they　gain:
-　Immunity　to　Soul　Jade　changes;
-　Clear　Petrification　when　acting;
-　Immunity　to　interruption;
-　Guaranteed　hits.

other_bundle_rows.skillDesc:
At　each　turn　start,　if　an　allied　<color=#d14e0d>Marine</color>　has　over　<color=#d14e0d>50%</color>　HP,　there　is　a　<color=#d14e0d>{buffodds}%</color>　chance　to　consume　<color=#d14e0d>50%</color>　of　its　HP　and　grant　an　equal　<color=#d14e0d>White　Shield</color>.　While　it　has　a　<color=#d14e0d>White　Shield</color>,　grant　<color=#d14e0d>all　damage　reduction</color>　based　on　lost　HP:　each　<color=#d14e0d>1%</color>　lost　raises　reduction　by　<color=#d14e0d>0.3%</color>.　When　a　<color=#d14e0d>White　Shield</color>　ends　or　its　owner　suffers　lethal　damage,　convert　any　remaining　<color=#d14e0d>White　Shield</color>　into　HP;　healing　bonuses　apply.
If　the　unit　starts　its　turn　below　<color=#d14e0d>50%</color>　HP,　convert　HP　to　a　<color=#d14e0d>White　Shield</color>　as　follows:
Above　<color=#d14e0d>40%</color>　and　below　<color=#d14e0d>50%</color>:　consume　at　most　<color=#d14e0d>40%</color>　Max　HP　for　an　equal　<color=#d14e0d>White　Shield</color>;
Above　<color=#d14e0d>30%</color>　and　below　<color=#d14e0d>40%</color>:　consume　at　most　<color=#d14e0d>30%</color>　Max　HP　for　an　equal　<color=#d14e0d>White　Shield</color>;
Above　<color=#d14e0d>20%</color>　and　below　<color=#d14e0d>30%</color>:　consume　at　most　<color=#d14e0d>20%</color>　Max　HP　for　an　equal　<color=#d14e0d>White　Shield</color>;
Above　<color=#d14e0d>10%</color>　and　below　<color=#d14e0d>20%</color>:　consume　at　most　<color=#d14e0d>10%</color>　Max　HP　for　an　equal　<color=#d14e0d>White　Shield</color>.
Below　<color=#d14e0d>10%</color>　HP,　conversion　stops.
